  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1301/275/mrpg-lib_title-png.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric|neoforge-black?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-rpg-classes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=discord&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Elemental-Wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🚨必要模組</h2>\n<p>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a>（+ 所有 Spell Engine 的依賴模組！）<br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Power Attributes</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>🌟<strong>功能特色</strong></h3>\n<p>- 單獨安裝此模組不會新增法術，您需要安裝您想使用的職業模組，才能為遊戲新增對應法術<br>- 此模組主要作為 More RPG Classes &amp; Content 系列模組的函式庫使用<br>- 供不同 RPG 職業使用的獨特實體屬性（EntityAttributes）<br>- 供不同 RPG 職業使用的全新狀態效果（Status Effects）</p>\n<p>關於此函式庫的更多資訊請見<a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/More-RPG-Library/blob/1.21.1/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>🧙&zwj;♂️探索使用此函式庫的其他 RPG 主題模組</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/709/archers_expansion_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/710/berserker_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/711/elemental_wizards_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/712/forcemaster_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/713/witcher_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>想體驗更多 RPG 內容嗎？來看看 Daedelus 創作的 RPG 系列模組！</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"聖騎士與牧師\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法師\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盜賊與戰士\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠寶飾品\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"史詩遺物\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"軍械庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武裝庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能樹\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>探索其他 Spell Engine 開發者創作的 RPG 內容</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"無政府狀態\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"僱傭兵與工匠\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡騎士\"></a></p>